    "intro" : {
        "shortDescription" : "Full-stack software engineer with 5+ years of experience working with enterprise SaaS and production software environments. My recent focus has been hands-on software development, building web and cross-platform applications while bridging technical and business needs.",
        "longDescriptionOne" : "I'm a detail-oriented Solutions Consultant and Full-Stack Developer with a background in client operations, collaborative technical delivery, and analytical problem-solving. I've spent over five years supporting SaaS platforms in the energy industry in both Japan and the US, helping to bridge the gap between technical teams and customer needs. I'm experienced with tools like React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, as  well as Python/Django, and I've led projects across both Agile and Waterfall environments. My strengths include stakeholder communication, project coordination, backend service integration, and frontend UI/UX design.",
        "longDescriptionTwo" : "I'm also passionate about building clean, intuitive web experiences, and this site is one of them! I designed and developed it using TypeScript, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS. I love solving real-world problems where business and engineering meet, and I'm always looking to create tools that are scalable, user-friendly, and thoughtfully designed. With a foundation in technical consulting and hands-on dev experience, I bring a well-rounded, practical approach to every project I work on."
